  "how": "- Open a file by double-clicking it or dragging it onto the window.\n- Open a whole folder from the Media menu.\n- Open discs by inserting them and choosing Play with VLC when your OS asks.\n- The Playlist view lists the current playlist, local media folders, optical drives, local network sources and internet sources such as radio and podcasts.\n- Playback controls cover volume, seeking and fullscreen.",
