  "how": "- Scenes are named layouts that you switch between.\n- Sources are items inside a scene, such as windows, displays, cameras, images or text; higher items sit on top.\n- The Audio Mixer controls volume for each audio device, with filter options per device.\n- The Preview shows where sources are placed; Studio Mode lets you edit a scene privately, then transition it live.\n- Streaming sends output to a service with a stream key; recording saves to a local file. Filters and hotkeys add effects and shortcuts.",
  "notFor": "- Editing a recording after capture; use Kdenlive.\n- Simply playing media files; use VLC.",
