 "yabridge": {
  "overview": "",
  "shots": [
   {
    "url": "screenshots/yabridge-shot-1.png",
    "caption": ""
   }
  ],
  "when": "- Your DAW is a 64-bit native Linux app and you need a Windows-only VST2, VST3 or CLAP plugin.\n- You run Bitwig Studio, REAPER, Carla or a similar native Linux host.\n- You want several Windows plugins to share a few Wine processes (plugin groups).\n- You already have Wine Staging and the plugins installed in a Wine prefix.",
  "how": "- Wraps Windows plugins so a Linux host can load them; it runs them through Wine.\n- Install by extracting the release archive to `~/.local/share/yabridge`, then `yabridgectl` manages the plugin folders.\n- `yabridgectl add <folder>` registers a Windows plugin folder; `yabridgectl sync` creates links in `~/.vst/yabridge`, `~/.vst3/yabridge` and `~/.clap/yabridge`. Rerun `sync` after updates or plugin changes.\n- Needs Wine Staging; the README says 5.1.1 was tested with Wine Staging 9.21 and that Wine 9.22 and 10.x did not work.",
  "notFor": "- Flatpak DAWs: the README says yabridge does not work with them; use native packages.\n- 32-bit-only Wine prefixes without the separate 32-bit build (`bitbridge`).",
  "commands": [
   {
    "method": "install from tarball",
    "command": "tar -C ~/.local/share -xavf yabridge-x.y.z.tar.gz",
    "root": "no",
    "source": "https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge"
   },
   {
    "method": "add plugin path",
    "command": "yabridgectl add \"$HOME/.wine/drive_c/Program Files/Steinberg/VstPlugins\"",
    "root": "no",
    "source": "https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge"
   },
   {
    "method": "sync plugins",
    "command": "yabridgectl sync",
    "root": "no",
    "source": "https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge"
   },
   {
    "method": "realtime group setup",
    "command": "sudo gpasswd -a \"$USER\" realtime",
    "root": "yes",
    "source": "https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge"
   },
   {
    "method": "disable rtkit",
    "command": "sudo systemctl mask rtkit-daemon.service",
    "root": "yes",
    "source": "https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge"
   }
  ],
  "commandsStatus": "Partly found: Setup commands found in the official README; the only image is a project screenshot, not a logo, and the README states no minimum RAM."
 },
